#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、このモニター…！
#. どこの会社が作ってるんだよ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What kind of monitor is this!? Who would even make\n"
"this kind of thing!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …モノクマ社って書いてある。
#. ディティールにこだわってんな…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It has \"Monokuma Co.\" written across it. I guess\n"
"they've covered all the details..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この監視カメラで…
#. ボクらが捜査してる姿を見てるって言うのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Whoever's behind this must be using these cameras to\n"
"observe our investigation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな事させて…
#. 一体何が目的なんだよ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To force us into a situation like this... What the\n"
"hell do they want from us!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
